    <div>
      <h3 class="text-card-title">Better healthcare</h3>
      <div class="mt-16">
        <p>Health data research must deliver clear benefits for patients and the public. When information from across the health system can be studied responsibly, it can lead to earlier diagnosis, more effective treatments and better ways to prevent illness &#8211; helping people live longer, healthier lives.</p>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>




<div
    class="c-icon-content col-innerblocks wp-block-icon-and-content"
  >
    <svg class="c-svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
