</svg>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-card-title">Better, more efficient research</h3>
      <div class="mt-16">
        <p>Researchers often face uncertainty about what data exists, how it can be used and how long access may take. By providing clearer information and more consistent processes, the service helps approved researchers plan with confidence, reducing delays and moving more quickly from question to insight. This helps accelerate discovery and development of innovations in prevention, diagnosis and treatment.</p>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>




<div
    class="c-icon-content col-innerblocks wp-block-icon-and-content"
  >
    <svg class="c-svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
