</svg>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-card-title">Data working together</h3>
      <div class="mt-16">
        <p>Bringing together data from hospitals, GP and other records creates a more complete picture of health and illness. This joined-up view helps researchers uncover insights that aren’t visible in isolation &#8211; opening up new opportunities to improve care and develop treatments.</p>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>




<div
    class="c-icon-content col-innerblocks wp-block-icon-and-content"
  >
