    <div>
      <h3 class="text-card-title">Strong data protection</h3>
      <div class="mt-16">
        <p>Robust data protection. Health data used for research will only be accessed by approved researchers to deliver approved research with demonstrable benefits. Clear safeguards ensure it is handled responsibly, maintaining public trust while enabling vital research.</p>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>




