      <h3 class="text-card-title">Expanding access to clinical trials</h3>
      <div class="mt-16">
        <p>Using health data at scale makes it easier for researchers to design better clinical trials for those who may benefit from new treatments. This gives more people the opportunity to take part in research and access cutting edge treatments sooner.<!-- notionvc: 67fc1eed-d5c8-4dd9-8ea6-05f7818f99f5 --></p>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>



