>
  <div class="o-wrapper u-flex c-quote__wrapper">
    <div class="c-quote__content">
      <svg class="c-svg c-quote__mark" width="66" height="62" viewBox="0 0 66 62" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M7.16922 61.0408H4.50636L0 48.7507C8.80789 46.2927 13.3143 39.9428 13.3143 29.701V27.6527H3.48219V0H28.8817V29.701C28.8817 45.883 21.7125 56.3296 7.16922 61.0408ZM41.3766 61.0408L36.8703 48.7507C45.6781 46.2927 50.1845 39.9428 50.1845 29.701V27.6527H40.3524V0H65.752V29.701C65.752 45.883 58.5827 56.3296 44.0395 61.0408H41.3766Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg>
      <div class="c-quote__text text-quote">
        <p>Mortality and treatment data from 10% of UK patients hospitalised during the pandemic found that for patients needing mechanical ventilation, an inexpensive steroid called dexamethasone reduced deaths by 36%. In cases of patients needing oxygen, mortality was reduced by 18%. Dexamethasone quickly became standard NHS treatment for patients needing ventilation or oxygen &#8211; saving 22,000 lives in the UK and over a million worldwide.</p>

      </div>

      <div class="c-quote__source">
        <p class="text-quote">Data to discovery</p>
        <p class="text-label">case study</p>
